CodeSystem: Form097ObservationCodeCS
Id: form-097-observation-code-cs
Title: "Form 097 Observation Codes"
Description: "Local codes for Form 097 observations that have no suitable LOINC or SNOMED CT code."

* insert OriginalCodeSystemDraft(form-097-observation-code-cs)

* #ballard-square-window "Kvadrat oyna (bilak)"
